value="&lt;b&gt;N : N relationships&lt;/b&gt; (drawn directly; the logical ERD resolves each through a table)&lt;br&gt;• UserProfile N : N Promotion — a user claims many vouchers, a voucher is claimed by many users (&lt;i&gt;promotion_claims&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• Promotion N : N LockerOrder — an order applies many vouchers, a voucher is applied to many orders (&lt;i&gt;promotion_usages&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• UserProfile (locker technician) N : N LockerUnit — BLE test access (&lt;i&gt;ble_test_grants&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• UserProfile (drone technician) N : N DronePickup — a home pickup is offered to many technicians (&lt;i&gt;drone_pickup_offers&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• UserProfile — LockerBox: a user books many boxes, a box is booked by many users at different times; kept as the &lt;b&gt;LockerOrder&lt;/b&gt; entity because the order has its own data and relationships (payment, status history, rating, drone mission …)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SystemSetting&lt;/b&gt;: unit prices set by the admin (send base fee, rental hourly / daily rate standard · XL, drone delivery fee, overtime fee per hour, weight-step fee …) and other business rules; every change is kept in SystemSettingAudit" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="1756.0" width="1568.0" height="140.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c133" value="" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="1922.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c134" value="" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90.0" y="1922.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c135" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;startArrow=none;endFill=0;endSize=12;endArrow=ERmandOne;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c133" target="c134"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c136" value="exactly one (parent side, FK NOT NULL)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="104.0" y="1908.0" width="700.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c137" value="" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="1952.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c138" value="" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90.0" y="1952.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c139" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;startArrow=none;endFill=0;endSize=12;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c137" target="c138"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c140" value="zero or one (parent side when the FK is nullable · child side of a 1 : 1)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="104.0" y="1938.0" width="700.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c141" value="" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="1982.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c142" value="" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90.0" y="1982.0" width="2.0" height="2.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c143" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;startArrow=none;endFill=0;endSize=12;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;exitX=0.5;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c141" target="c142"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c144" value="zero or many (child side of a 1 : N · both ends of an N : N)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="104.0" y="1968.0" width="700.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>